JSONTestSuite's parsing tests, the files in its test_parsing/ as they
are, from https://github.com/nst/JSONTestSuite at commit
1ef36fa01286573e846ac449e8683f8833c5b26a (Nov 2024). LICENSE is its
licence (MIT).

A file named y_... must parse, and one named n_... must not; one named
i_... is left to the parser (DECISIONS.md, D162, says what slight's
does). t/177-json-suite.slight reads them all, in the order files.txt
lists them, since a slight program can't list a directory.
